# The held-port image's build reads the infra workspace's two modules, packages/envoy and the
# envoy-infra module under it, nothing else of the repository root it takes as its context. It
# leaves out what the root .dockerignore leaves out of packages/envoy but infra, which this build
# compiles: test files, internal/integration, internal/smoke, deploy, the changelog fragments and
# build output.
*
!packages/envoy
packages/envoy/**/*_test.go
packages/envoy/internal/integration/
packages/envoy/internal/smoke/
packages/envoy/deploy/
packages/envoy/.changes/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
